# image 1
Style: Chinese Ink Wash (Sumi-e)
Aspect Ratio: 16:9
A quiet still life of tea storage on a wooden shelf: several round ceramic and unglazed clay tea jars with lids, a small metal tea tin, and a wrapped round pu-erh tea cake resting nearby, soft diffused light, muted earthy tones with gentle watercolor washes, minimalist Chinese ink wash painting style, plenty of negative space, no text.
